          },
          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Dino-sized tennis anyone? Get your game on with Terry the T. Rex! Or how about a stone-aged snack? Help pick the most perfect Yum fruit with a hungry, clever stegosaurus! Rock out with an epic “tree drum” solo from Percy the parasaurolophus, track Trudy the Troodon’s message to rescue a brachiosaurus from a swamp, and spread your wings with a mischievous pteranodon who needs to save her village from bubbling lava!  Travel back in time for some Bronto-sized adventures and Jurassic era laughs!\n\nWritten by Joe Vitale\n\nTracks Included: \n\nT. Rex Games \nHow to Get To Yum \nThe Crooked Crest \nThe Mixed Up Message\nWinging It ",
